msgid "Inside the influence sphere, render what a camera hovering in place (held by rockets) would see: light is blueshifted and brighter close to the hole, and the camera's view angles change the shadow's size. Off: the camera sees light as in flat space"
msgstr "在影响球内，渲染悬停（由火箭固定）的相机所见的景象：靠近黑洞的光会蓝移并变亮，相机视角会改变阴影的大小。关闭：相机按平坦空间方式观察光线"

#: ui.py:78
msgid "Inside the photon sphere: Exact mode is more accurate"
msgstr "在光子球内：精确模式更准确"

#: properties.py:46
msgid "Integrates every light ray with RK4 in an OSL shader. CPU only. Adds frame dragging and volumetric jets along curved paths"
msgstr "在 OSL 着色器中用 RK4 对每条光线积分。仅限 CPU。沿弯曲路径添加参考系拖曳和体积喷流"

